    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="21.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Grith">Grið</ref> 21.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ac þa ne beoð na wise ne fullice gescade, þe Gode nellað hyran ne bet understandan hu oft he of lytlan arærde to miclan þa þe hira hyrdan and mid rihte gecwemdon.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Indeed, they are neither wise nor entirely perceptive who will not obey God nor better understand how often he has raised from insignificance to greatness those who obeyed him and pleased him rightly.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ac þa ne beoð na wise ne fullice gescade, þe Gode nellað hyran ne bet understandan, hu oft he of lytlan arærde to miclan þa þe hira hyrdan 7 mid rihte gecwemdon.</ab>
      </div>
